{"_id":"swse000000000301","name":"TIE Fighter","type":"vehicle","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"model":"TIE Fighter","sourcebook":"Core Rulebook","page":179,"category":"Starfighter","type":"Starfighter","size":"Huge starfighter","vehicleBucket":"starfighters","vehicleFamily":"starship","weapons":[],"vehicleHasWeapons":false,"vehicleWeaponDataStatus":"PUBLISHED_GROUPS_NOT_INSTALLED","vehicleCanonicalSourceState":"SOURCE_REVIEWED_PHYSICAL_MOUNTS_UNVERIFIED","challengeLevel":7,"initiative":8,"reflexDefense":15,"flatFooted":11,"fortitudeDefense":22,"damageThreshold":32,"damageReduction":10,"hp":{"value":60,"max":60,"temp":0},"hull":{"value":60,"max":60,"temp":0},"characterScaleSpeed":16,"maxVelocityKmh":1200,"vehicleMovementRaw":"Speed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,200 km/h), fly 5 squares","speed":"Fly 16 squares","crew":"Crew 1 (skilled); Passengers none","vehicleHyperdriveLabel":"hyperdrives, or life support-not ever Fighting Space 3x3 or 1 square (starship scale); Cover total","vehicleCanonicalMissingFields":[]},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalPublication":{"sourceEntryKey":"core-tie-fighter","sourceBook":"Core Rulebook","printedPage":179,"sourcePdfSha256":"509c4a701a83cebf00ba91574eec88d60d1ea96d4849d22d2c5f1f176bc32fd9","originalPrintedFacts":{"challengeLevel":7,"printedTypeLine":"Huge starfighter","sourceTxtNavigationOnly":true,"initiativeAndSenses":"Init +8; Senses Perception +6","defensesAsPrinted":"Defense Ref 15 (flat footed 11), Fort 22; +3 armor","hitPointsAndShieldsAsPrinted":"hp 60; DR 10; Threshold 32 a a","speedAsPrinted":"Speed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,200 km/h), fly 5 squares","rangedAttackFirstLine":"Ranged laser cannons +4 (see below}","baseAttackAndGrapple":"Base Atk +2; Grp +24","attackOptions":"Atk Options autofire (laser cannons)","crewAndPassengers":"Crew 1 (skilled); Passengers none","cargoConsumablesAndCarriedCraft":"Cargo 65 kg; Consumables 2 days; Carried Craft none","hyperdriveAsPrinted":"hyperdrives, or life support-not ever Fighting Space 3x3 or 1 square (starship scale); Cover total","economicsAsPrinted":"Availability Military; Cost 60,000 (25,000 used)","navigationTextExcerpt":"TIE Fighter CL7 \n\n\nHuge starfighter \n\n\n— \nrpedoes (gunner) \nein e Init +8; Senses Perception +6 \n\n\nAtk +5, Dmg 9d10x2, 4-square splash \n\n\nDefense Ref 15 (flat footed 11), Fort 22; +3 armor \n\n\nTIE Fighter hp 60; DR 10; Threshold 32 a a \n\n\nCheap and efficient, TIE fighters are not so much feared for their capabilities Speed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,200 km/h), fly 5 squares \nas their numbers. Mass-prod uced by Sienar Fleet Systems, TIE fighters cost (starship scale) \n\nonly a fraction oF what a comparable fighter costs. Keeping the price dowr Ranged laser cannons +4 (see below} \n\nmeans that TIE fighters have no shie ds, hyperdrives, or life support—not ever Fighting Space 3x3 or 1 square (starship scale); Cover total \ncockpit gravity They can't even land without special supports. The Imperia Base Atk +2; Grp +24 \n\nNavy believes that this teaches pilots to rely on higher authorities. In reality, Atk Options autofire (laser cannons) \n\n\nSN \n\n\npd al) ta \n\n\nf \n\n\nAbilities Str 34, Dex 18, Con —, Int 14 \n\nSkills Initiative +8, Mechanics +6, Perception +6, Pilot +8 \nCrew 1 (skilled); Passengers none \n\nCargo 65 kg; Consumables 2 days; Carried Craft none \nAvailability Military; Cost 60,000 (25,000 used) \n\n\nLaser cannons \nAtk +4 (-1 autofire), Dmg 4d10x2 \n\n\nTIE Interceptor \n\nThe TIE interceptor was designed specifically to counteract the Rebel Alliance \nX-wing. To increase speed and firepower, the designers at Sienar gave it large \nengines, more powerful energy converters, and a package of four fire-linked \nlaser cannons. Although put into production before the Battle of Yavin, the"},"approvedEffectiveFacts":null,"attackRows":[{"weaponLabel":"laser cannons","station":"pilot","attackBonus":4,"damageAsPrinted":"4d10x2","printedMultiplicity":null,"sourcePrintedPage":180,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"}],"sourceConflicts":[],"missingFields":[],"physicalMountCertified":false,"foundryStockAttackTrusted":false}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"swse000000000302","name":"TIE Interceptor","type":"vehicle","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"model":"TIE Interceptor","sourcebook":"Core Rulebook","page":179,"category":"Starfighter","type":"Starfighter","size":"Huge starfighter","vehicleBucket":"starfighters","vehicleFamily":"starship","weapons":[],"vehicleHasWeapons":false,"vehicleWeaponDataStatus":"PUBLISHED_GROUPS_NOT_INSTALLED","vehicleCanonicalSourceState":"SOURCE_REVIEWED_PHYSICAL_MOUNTS_UNVERIFIED","challengeLevel":8,"initiative":11,"reflexDefense":18,"flatFooted":11,"fortitudeDefense":24,"damageThreshold":34,"damageReduction":10,"hp":{"value":90,"max":90,"temp":0},"hull":{"value":90,"max":90,"temp":0},"characterScaleSpeed":16,"starshipScaleSpeed":5,"maxVelocityKmh":1250,"vehicleMovementRaw":"Speed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,250 km/h), fly 5 squares (starship scale)","speed":"Fly 16 squares","starshipSpeed":"Fly 5 squares","crew":"Crew 1 (skilled); Passengers none","vehicleHyperdriveLabel":"Hyperdrive x1 (with booster ring), 10-jump memory (astromech droid","vehicleCanonicalMissingFields":[]},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalPublication":{"sourceEntryKey":"core-tie-interceptor","sourceBook":"Core Rulebook","printedPage":179,"sourcePdfSha256":"509c4a701a83cebf00ba91574eec88d60d1ea96d4849d22d2c5f1f176bc32fd9","originalPrintedFacts":{"challengeLevel":8,"printedTypeLine":"Huge starfighter","sourceTxtNavigationOnly":true,"initiativeAndSenses":"Init +11; Senses Perception +6","defensesAsPrinted":"Defense Ref 18 (flat-footed 11), Fort 24; +3 armor","hitPointsAndShieldsAsPrinted":"hp 90; DR 10; Threshold 34","speedAsPrinted":"Speed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,250 km/h), fly 5 squares (starship scale)","rangedAttackFirstLine":"Ranged laser cannons +5 (see below)","baseAttackAndGrapple":"Base Atk +2; Grp +26","attackOptions":"Atk Options autofire (laser cannons)","crewAndPassengers":"Crew 1 (skilled); Passengers none","cargoConsumablesAndCarriedCraft":"Cargo 60 kg; Consumables 2 days (1 week with booster ring);","hyperdriveAsPrinted":"Hyperdrive x1 (with booster ring), 10-jump memory (astromech droid","economicsAsPrinted":"Availability Military; Cost 120,000 (50,000 used)","navigationTextExcerpt":"TIE Interceptor CL8 \n\nHuge starfighter \n\nInit +11; Senses Perception +6 \n\nDefense Ref 18 (flat-footed 11), Fort 24; +3 armor \n\nhp 90; DR 10; Threshold 34 \n\nSpeed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,250 km/h), fly 5 squares \n(starship scale) \n\nRanged laser cannons +5 (see below) \n\nFighting Space 3x3 or 1 square (starship scale); Cover total \n\nBase Atk +2; Grp +26 \n\nAtk Options autofire (laser cannons) \n\nAbilities Str 38, Dex 24, Con —, Int 16 \n\nSkills Initiative +11, Mechanics +6, Perception +6, Pilot +11 \n\nCrew 1 (skilled); Passengers none \n\nCargo 75 kg: Consumables 2 days; Carried Craft none \n\nAvailability Military; Cost 120,000 (50,000 used) \n\n\nLaser cannons (pilot) \nAtk +5 (+0 autofire), Dmg 6d10x2 \n\n\nEta-2 Actis Interceptor \n\nDesigned to take advantage of Jedi reflexes and piloting skills, the nimble \nEta-2 Actis Interceptor is the foremost starfighter used by the Jedi during \nthe Clone Wars. Unlike many other starfighters, the Eta-2 does not boast \nany shields, relying on the pilot's ability to avoid incoming damage rather \nthan protective shielding. \n\n\nEta-2 Actis Interceptor \n\nHuge starfighter \n\nInit +18; Senses Perception +12 \n\nDefense Ref 19 (flat-footed 11), Fort 22; +3 armor \n\nhp 70; DR 10; Threshold 32 \n\nSpeed fly 16 squares (max. velocity 1,500 km/h), fly 6 squares = \n(starship scale) \n\nRanged laser cannons +12 (see below) or \n\nRanged ion cannons +12 (see below) \n\nFighting Space 3x3 or 1 square (starship scale); Cover total (pilot \n(astromech droid) \n\nBase Atk +10; Grp +32 \n\nAtk Options autofire (laser cannons, ion cannons) \n\nAbilities Str 34, Dex 26, Con —, Int 14"},"approvedEffectiveFacts":null,"attackRows":[{"weaponLabel":"laser cannons","station":"pilot","attackBonus":5,"damageAsPrinted":"6d10x2","printedMultiplicity":null,"sourcePrintedPage":180,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"}],"sourceConflicts":[],"missingFields":[],"physicalMountCertified":false,"foundryStockAttackTrusted":false}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
