{"_id":"swse000000000304","name":"Corona-class Armed Transport","type":"vehicle","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"model":"Corona-class Armed Transport","sourcebook":"Galaxy at War","page":67,"category":"Capital Ship","type":"Capital Ship","size":"Colossal (frigate)","vehicleBucket":"capital-ships","vehicleFamily":"starship","weapons":[],"vehicleHasWeapons":false,"vehicleWeaponDataStatus":"PUBLISHED_GROUPS_NOT_INSTALLED","vehicleCanonicalSourceState":"SOURCE_REVIEWED_PHYSICAL_MOUNTS_UNVERIFIED","challengeLevel":17,"initiative":0,"reflexDefense":15,"flatFooted":11,"fortitudeDefense":35,"damageThreshold":135,"damageReduction":15,"hp":{"value":750,"max":750,"temp":0},"hull":{"value":750,"max":750,"temp":0},"shields":{"value":60,"max":60},"shieldRating":60,"currentSR":60,"vehicleHasShields":true,"characterScaleSpeed":3,"starshipScaleSpeed":3,"vehicleMovementRaw":"Speed fly 3 squares (starship scale)","speed":"Fly 3 squares","starshipSpeed":"Fly 3 squares","crew":"Crew 64; Passengers 200","vehicleHyperdriveLabel":"Hyperdrive x1, navicomputer","vehicleCanonicalMissingFields":[]},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalPublication":{"sourceEntryKey":"gaw-corona-class-armed-transport","sourceBook":"Galaxy at War","printedPage":67,"sourcePdfSha256":"9829bea74df5dddad946b1f5514caf1838328333979eb573f9b565334258aa4a","originalPrintedFacts":{"challengeLevel":17,"printedTypeLine":"Colossal (frigate) capital ship","sourceTxtNavigationOnly":true,"initiativeAndSenses":"Init +0; Senses Perception +6","defensesAsPrinted":"Defense Ref 15 (flat-footed 11), Fort 35; +11 armor","hitPointsAndShieldsAsPrinted":"hp 750; DR 15; SR 60; Threshold 135","speedAsPrinted":"Speed fly 3 squares (starship scale)","rangedAttackFirstLine":"Ranged 2 medium turbolaser batteries +10° (see below) and","baseAttackAndGrapple":"Base Atk +2; Grp +47","crewAndPassengers":"Crew 64; Passengers 200","cargoConsumablesAndCarriedCraft":"Cargo 450 tons; Consumables 1 year; Carried Craft 6 attack shuttles,","hyperdriveAsPrinted":"Hyperdrive x1, navicomputer","economicsAsPrinted":"Availability Restricted; Cost 3,7 million (2.0 million used)","navigationTextExcerpt":"Corona-class Armed Transport CL17 \n\nColossal (frigate) capital ship \n\nInit +0; Senses Perception +6 \n\nDefense Ref 15 (flat-footed 11), Fort 35; +11 armor \n\nhp 750; DR 15; SR 60; Threshold 135 \n\nSpeed fly 3 squares (starship scale) \n\nRanged 2 medium turbolaser batteries +10° (see below) and \n4 heavy ion cannon batteries +10° (see below) and \n4 point-defense medium laser cannon batteries +6 (see below) and \ntractor beam battery +10* (see below) \n\nFighting Space 1 square (starship scale); Cover total (crew) \n\nBase Atk +2; Grp +47 \n\nAbilities Str 60, Dex 18, Con —, Int 14 \n\nSkills Initiative +0, Mechanics +6, Perception +6, Pilot +0, \nUse Computer +6 \n\nCrew 64; Passengers 200 \n\nCargo 450 tons; Consumables 1 year; Carried Craft 6 attack shuttles, \n12 speeder tanks \n\nHyperdrive x1, navicomputer \n\nAvailability Restricted; Cost 3,7 million (2.0 million used) \n\n“Apply a -20 penalty on attacks against targets smaller than Colossal size. \n\n\nMedium turbolaser battery (4 gunners) \nAtk +10, Dmg 5d10x5 \nHeavy ion cannon battery (4 gunners) \nAtk +10, Dmg 4d10x5 ion \nPoint-defense medium laser cannon battery (2 gunners) \nAtk +6, Dmg 4d10x2 \nTractor beam battery (4 gunners) \nAtk +10, Dmg - (grapple +47) \n\n\nVEHICLE AND \n\nSTARSHIP WEAPONS \n\nThe following new vehicle weapons can be used to create different vehicle \ncombat dynamics. The statistics for these vehicle weapons use the format of \nstarship upgrades from the Starships of the Galoxy supplement, but a Game- \nmaster can add these weapons to the vehicle without using that system. \n\n\nEMPLACEMENT \nWEAPON DAMAGE POINTS cosT \nChaff gun - 1 2,0"},"approvedEffectiveFacts":null,"attackRows":[{"weaponLabel":"medium turbolaser battery","station":"4 gunners","attackBonus":10,"damageAsPrinted":"5d10x5","printedMultiplicity":2,"sourcePrintedPage":67,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"},{"weaponLabel":"heavy ion cannon battery","station":"4 gunners","attackBonus":10,"damageAsPrinted":"4d10x5 ion","printedMultiplicity":4,"sourcePrintedPage":67,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"},{"weaponLabel":"point-defense medium laser cannon battery","station":"2 gunners","attackBonus":6,"damageAsPrinted":"4d10x2","printedMultiplicity":4,"sourcePrintedPage":67,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"},{"weaponLabel":"tractor beam battery","station":"4 gunners","attackBonus":10,"damageAsPrinted":"grapple +47","printedMultiplicity":1,"sourcePrintedPage":67,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"}],"sourceConflicts":[],"missingFields":[],"physicalMountCertified":false,"foundryStockAttackTrusted":false}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"_id":"swse000000000305","name":"Imperial Landing Craft","type":"vehicle","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"model":"Imperial Landing Craft","sourcebook":"Galaxy at War","page":64,"category":"Space Transport","type":"Space Transport","size":"Colossal space","vehicleBucket":"space-transports","vehicleFamily":"starship","weapons":[],"vehicleHasWeapons":false,"vehicleWeaponDataStatus":"PUBLISHED_GROUPS_NOT_INSTALLED","vehicleCanonicalSourceState":"SOURCE_REVIEWED_PHYSICAL_MOUNTS_UNVERIFIED","challengeLevel":13,"initiative":0,"reflexDefense":14,"flatFooted":12,"fortitudeDefense":27,"damageThreshold":77,"damageReduction":15,"hp":{"value":140,"max":140,"temp":0},"hull":{"value":140,"max":140,"temp":0},"shields":{"value":40,"max":40},"shieldRating":40,"currentSR":40,"vehicleHasShields":true,"characterScaleSpeed":12,"starshipScaleSpeed":4,"maxVelocityKmh":800,"vehicleMovementRaw":"Speed fly 12 squares (max. velocity 800 km/h), fly 4 squares (starship scale)","speed":"Fly 12 squares","starshipSpeed":"Fly 4 squares","crew":"Crew 8 (expert); Passengers 120 troops","vehicleHyperdriveLabel":"Hyperdrive x1, navicomputer","vehicleCanonicalMissingFields":[]},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalPublication":{"sourceEntryKey":"gaw-imperial-landing-craft","sourceBook":"Galaxy at War","printedPage":64,"sourcePdfSha256":"9829bea74df5dddad946b1f5514caf1838328333979eb573f9b565334258aa4a","originalPrintedFacts":{"challengeLevel":13,"printedTypeLine":"Colossal space transport","sourceTxtNavigationOnly":true,"initiativeAndSenses":"Init +0; Senses Perception +8","defensesAsPrinted":"Defense Ref 14 (flat-footed 12), Fort 27; +12 armor","hitPointsAndShieldsAsPrinted":"hp 140; DR 15; SR 40; Threshold 77","speedAsPrinted":"Speed fly 12 squares (max. velocity 800 km/h), fly 4 squares (starship scale)","rangedAttackFirstLine":"Ranged double medium laser cannons +10 (see below) and","baseAttackAndGrapple":"Base Atk +5; Grp +42","attackOptions":"Atk Options autofire (double medium laser cannons, antipersonnel heavy","crewAndPassengers":"Crew 8 (expert); Passengers 120 troops","cargoConsumablesAndCarriedCraft":"Cargo 130 tons; Consumables 6 months; Carried Craft 12 speeder bikes,","hyperdriveAsPrinted":"Hyperdrive x1, navicomputer","economicsAsPrinted":"Availability Military; Cost 290,000 credits","navigationTextExcerpt":"Imperial Landing Craft CL 13 \nColossal space transport \nInit +0; Senses Perception +8 \nDefense Ref 14 (flat-footed 12), Fort 27; +12 armor \nhp 140; DR 15; SR 40; Threshold 77 \nSpeed fly 12 squares (max. velocity 800 km/h), fly 4 squares \n\n(starship scale) \n\nRanged double medium laser cannons +10 (see below) and \n\n4 antipersonnel heavy blaster cannons +8 (see below) \n\nFighting Space 12x12 or 1 square (starship scale); Cover total (crew) \n\nBase Atk +5; Grp +42 \n\nAtk Options autofire (double medium laser cannons, antipersonnel heavy \nblaster cannons) \n\nAbilities Str 44, Dex 14, Con—, Int 16 \n\nSkills Initiative +0, Mechanics +8, Perception +8, Pilot +0, \n\nUse Computer +8 \nCrew 8 (expert); Passengers 120 troops \nCargo 130 tons; Consumables 6 months; Carried Craft 12 speeder bikes, \n\n2 LAVr QH-7 Chariot command speeders, 1 PX-4 mobile command base \nHyperdrive x1, navicomputer \nAvailability Military; Cost 290,000 credits \n\n\nDouble medium laser cannons (pilot) \nAtk +10 (+5 autofire), Dmg 5d10x2 \nAntipersonnel heavy blaster cannons (gunner) \nAtk +8 (+3 autofire), Dmg 5d10x2 \n\n\nPenumbra-class Attack Shuttle \nThe Haor Chall Engineering Penumbra-class attack shuttle was produced in \nrelatively small numbers prior to the Clone Wars. As the Trade Federation and \nthe rest of the Confederacy ramped up for all-out war, second-tier vehicle \ndesigns (such as the Penumbra-class attack shuttle) saw drastically smaller \nproduction runs. Since the Penumbra-class attack shuttle was one of the \ndesigns deemed inefficient for the Confederacy's needs, the factories dedi- \ncated to producing the vesse"},"approvedEffectiveFacts":null,"attackRows":[{"weaponLabel":"double medium laser cannons","station":"pilot","attackBonus":10,"damageAsPrinted":"5d10x2","printedMultiplicity":1,"sourcePrintedPage":64,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"},{"weaponLabel":"antipersonnel heavy blaster cannons","station":"gunner","attackBonus":8,"damageAsPrinted":"5d10x2","printedMultiplicity":4,"sourcePrintedPage":64,"firingArc":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED","physicalMountCount":"NOT_CERTIFIED","batteryComposition":"SOURCE_SILENT_CONFIRMED"}],"sourceConflicts":[],"missingFields":[],"physicalMountCertified":false,"foundryStockAttackTrusted":false}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
